    "title": "Rashee Rice Suspended for Six Games by NFL",
    "text": "• Kansas City Chiefs wide receiver Rashee Rice has been suspended for six games.\n• The suspension is due to a violation of the NFL’s personal conduct policy.\n• Rice pleaded guilty to two third-degree felony charges related to a March 2024 crash in Dallas.\n• The NFL's decision follows an internal investigation and voids a scheduled hearing.\n• Rice will miss several high-profile games, including the season opener against the Chargers in Brazil.\n• He will also miss a Super Bowl rematch with the Eagles.\n• Rice is eligible to return on October 19 when the Chiefs face the Raiders.",
